# SPT Leaderboard frontend — build-time environment (PUBLIC_ vars only).
# Astro inlines these into client bundles at build time, so never put a
# secret here and never point a PUBLIC var at anything private.

# Base URL of the SPTLB v2 website API (backend docs/api/openapi.yaml).
#   Unset or empty (default): the site serves its bundled mock fixtures
#   (src/mocks/) — exactly the committed snapshots, no network calls.
#   Set: the data layer (src/api/client.ts) switches to the real v2 API at
#   this origin, e.g. the backend dev server:
#     PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:51473
#PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
